 out that both Mother Gothel and  the Evil Queen where apply ops which is  a medieval style dress it wouldn't make  sense for the Evil Queen to wear this  dress since Snow White's time period  doesn't correspond to the period when  blades was a popular choice of clothing  the fan goes on explaining that Mother  Gothel and the Evil Queen share many  more similarities and claims they're  actually the same person according to  the theory the Evil Queen just faked her  own death since her body is never seen  and became Mother Gothel the similar  clothes the similar personalities could  be a connection between these two and  did you ever notice the bannister of  Rapunzel's tower has a painting of a  poison apple we always knew there was  something strange about Mother Gothel  but we never thought she could actually  be another Disney character what do you  think about this theory make sure to let  us know in the comments Beauty and the  Beast and Aladdin if you're a Disney fan  you're probably already familiar with  this one but do you know these two  movies have more than just one  connection Beauty and the Beast has  multiple connections to Aladdin most  people don't even notice but this  definitely becomes more obvious when you  watch the movies more than once and pay  attention to small details we all have  our favorite books and sodas Belle when  she goes to the book shop she starts  talking about her favorite novel she  talks about a prince in disguise  located in far-off places with daring  sword fights and magic spells those were  her words of choice not ours she also  describes the plot saying that the  princess meets her prince but doesn't  discover that it's him until a few  chapters after sounds familiar that's  not the only connection in Aladdin we  see Sultan's stacking up a bunch of toys  figurines if you pay attention to them  you'll notice that one of them is a  she'll eat beasts while the theory with  the book wasn't confirmed by Disney a  former animat