h their newborn  baby boy built a tree house within got  eaten by a leopard and yes this is  pretty much the plot of Tarzan the  animators said that in his head anna and  elsa are actually the older sisters of  tarzan talk about insane Disney  connections that bring together three  movies made in completely different  times this  is so big fans have even mapped out  locations of the two movies to make  sense of why the king and queen get  washed up so far away from their actual  location but then again Disney's storms  can be pretty aggressive anyways we'd  love to know what you think of these  crazy connections and if you have a  theory of your own write it in the  comments that's it for our video don't  forget to subscribe to the things and  hit that like button for more videos  like this one see you next time  [Music]

